{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226550","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226550","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1422655001:1":{"text":"여기는 제가 생각하던 것과 다른 세계군요.","source_cn":"这里，真是与我想象得格外不同。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD80A7ED5F74AB795","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422655002:1":{"text":"이곳이 셀로클랜드와 다를 거라고 각오는 하고 왔지만, 막상 마주하고 나니 더 놀랍습니다.","source_cn":"尽管我已经做过心理准备，知道此处会与萨洛克兰大相径庭，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF038E72F761BE377","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422655003:1":{"text":"이곳은 정말로 자유롭고, 유쾌한 곳이군요.","source_cn":"这里的一切都是如此的，轻松，自由而又愉快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22D8AD882C75DBE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422655004:1":{"text":"하지만 갈등과 다툼이 없는 건 아닙니다.","source_cn":"也有紧张，同样也少不了纠纷。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAF39F10A50814C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422655005:1":{"text":"이기심, 질투, 기만, 상처... 저희도 이런 감정으로부터 자유롭지는 못합니다.","source_cn":"自私、嫉妒、欺骗、伤害，我们并不能免俗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4065BFD14C294F99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422655006:1":{"text":"하지만 그건 의심이나 공포, 증오와는 다릅니다. 그런 분위기가 기본적으로 깔려있지도 않고요.","source_cn":"但，那并不是猜疑，恐慌与憎恨。至少不是普遍的情绪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90A94D65EDFE3D54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422655007:1":{"text":"에세일도 미샤르테의 사랑을 계속 받았다면, 만약 그랬다면...","source_cn":"如果艾塞勒也一直被弥萨忒爱着，那么，会不会……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x864283331DB653E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422655008:1":{"text":"죄송합니다. 추태를 보였군요. 브라이트문 나무를 가까이서 봐도 되겠습니까?","source_cn":"抱歉，我失态了。我能不能走近看看皎月树？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF511CD91F08C5F27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422655009:1":{"text":"정원사님이 말씀하신 수호의 나무가 궁금합니다. 어쩌면...","source_cn":"花匠提到的守护之树令我很是好奇。或许……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB6EEC442BEFB4CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422655010:1":{"text":"물론입니다. 편하게 둘러보세요.","source_cn":"当然，请便。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72C0622AC1E13612","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"브라이언","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":2}}